":2666708059,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4MDU5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:2d","name":"topic:2d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":10,"created_at":"2026-03-30T07:57:17Z","updated_at":"2026-07-18T19:07:17Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n4.6.2 rc1\n\n### System information\n\nwindows10 \n\n### Issue description\n\n2d modulate had a new improvement brightness, however this is badly made.\n- The image max (i) always turns the image white, and NOT the color the user has defined.\n- Color needs to BLEND to COLOR, and not BLEND TO WHITE ( unless user chooses WHITE )\n- example: User chooses \"bright orange\" max (i) , \"100%\"makes image complety \"bright orange\"\n\n<img width=\"1139\" height=\"624\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5042fca5-cfa7-42c8-8186-621b411668da\" />\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nadd a background color rect node, change the color; Add a sprite and modulate it, to the same color that the background has.\n\nFIX: This shader blends the image the right way, but,\nthere is an error a stroke sometimes appears around the image. ( mostly when using tilemaps )\n\n```\nshader_type canvas_item;\n\nuniform vec4 color_over : source_color = vec4(1.0);\nuniform float mix_amount : hint_range(0.0, 1.0);\n\nvoid fragment() {\n\t\t//COLOR.rgb = mix( COLOR.rgb, color_over.rgb, mix_amount ); // stroke around image FIX\n\t\tCOLOR = mix( COLOR, color_over, mix_amount * COLOR.a );\n}\n\n```\n\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nmpr\n\n[bad-2d-modulate.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/26343139/bad-2d-modulate.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117992/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117992/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"reopened","pinned_comment":null}